Models the app downloads (not included here)
--------------------------------------------

The speech model (NVIDIA Parakeet, through FluidAudio) and the public Qwen3.5 conversions
(mlx-community, Apache-2.0) are downloaded from Hugging Face under their own licences.


Corpora the recipe downloads (not included here)
-------------------------------------------------

The training and evaluation scripts download public corpora from their own hosts. Each keeps its own
licence; scripts record a licence tag on every row they build (Evals/meeting-extract/LICENSES.md,
training/README.md). For example, the AMI Meeting Corpus and the ICSI Meeting Corpus are licensed
under CC BY 4.0, which requires attribution in any model trained on them.
